WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.663
The licensing decision is recorded.

3
00:00:03.663 --> 00:00:06.457
Every in-scope app is
top-tier, single-tenant,

4
00:00:06.457 --> 00:00:10.339
listed by its enterprise
application ID, in exactly one ring,

5
00:00:10.339 --> 00:00:14.763
and everything out of scope names
the control that covers it instead.

6
00:00:14.763 --> 00:00:19.387
The egress location holds only the
workload ranges and isn't trusted.

7
00:00:19.387 --> 00:00:21.612
Every policy started report-only.

8
00:00:21.612 --> 00:00:24.281
Each ring was enforced in its own change,

9
00:00:24.281 --> 00:00:29.051
on two clean weeks of reviewed evidence,
with the alert already in place.

10
00:00:29.051 --> 00:00:32.662
Next, Chapter 9 takes
on AI agent identities.

11
00:00:32.662 --> 00:00:33.820
Thanks for watching.
